# Build outputs
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/target
**/output
**/packages
**/nuget

# IDE and editor files
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/_ReSharper.Caches
**/.classpath
**/.project
**/.settings
**/.toolstarget
**/*.*proj.user
**/*.dbmdl
**/*.jfm

# Logs and temporary files
**/_logs
**/npm-debug.log
**/*.log
**/*.binlog

# Docker files (don't include docker folder in build context)
docker/
**/docker-compose*
**/Dockerfile*

# Git
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# Documentation and non-essential files
README.md
LICENSE
**/*.md
!ref/docs/
!ref/diagrams/
!ref/design/
!ref/tests/
!ref/sql/
!ref/template*.txt
!ref/LINQPad/

# Archives and vault files
!ref/*.7z
!ref/vault.7z
!ref/vault.json
!ref/vault.*.json

# Configuration files that shouldn't be in image
**/.env
**/secrets.dev.yaml
**/values.dev.yaml
**/azds.yaml
# Test and coverage files
**/TestResults
**/coverage
**/.coverage
**/OpenCover

# OS files
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Large directories that aren't needed for build
images/
shared/nginx/vhost.d/

# Lock files (we'll restore packages in container)
**/*.lock
!pnpm-lock.yaml

# Other build artifacts
**/charts
**/CMakeFiles
**/CMakeCache.txt
**/.localhistory
**/.mfractor
**/.ionide
**/MigrationBackup
**/healthchecksdb
**/BSCPWGen-cache
**/Generated Images
**/Setup Files
**/.scannerwork
**/PublishProfiles
**/ServiceDependencies
**/.sec
